  "description": "The administrative surface for the DynamicWhere.ex field-level policy layer: schema discovery, rule management, explain, simulate and health endpoints, a ClaimsPrincipal adapter, and per-request audit draining. Endpoints refuse to map without a named authorization policy. Targets .NET 6+.",
